# API & Auth Rules

## Every case API route

```ts
if (!isDatabaseConfigured()) {
  return NextResponse.json({ error: "Database not configured" }, { status: 503 });
}
const userId = await requireAuthUserId();
const caseRecord = await getOwnedCase(caseId, userId); // for [id] routes
```

Never trust client-sent `userId`. Always filter by session.

## Middleware

Protected: `/cases/*`, `/api/cases/*` only. Do not protect `/analyze/*` or `/api/auth/*`.

## Registration vs login

- Register: `POST /api/auth/register` (bcrypt in route)
- Login: NextAuth Credentials in `src/auth.ts`

## Production auth

`AUTH_SECRET` required on Vercel. Missing → "Server error" page.
